## Extended runs
Two further runs, `extended.py 55` and `extended.py 120`, were started together with the pilot at 2026-10-19T10:24:32Z as `local-compute` background jobs. They run for 55 and 120 minutes respectively. They are for a later study and are not part of this delivery.

